# The terminal type of hcG-UI's own panes (the sidebar and the tab bar), compiled by start.sh into the window
# folder: tmux's screen-256color with SGR mouse codes, so a click keeps its column past column 223 of a wide window
# (screen-256color's X10 codes stop there). ncurses 6.0 (macOS) reads SGR codes only for a name with "xterm" in it.
xterm-hcgui|screen-256color with SGR mouse codes for hcG-UI,
	kmous=\E[<, XM=\E[?1006;1000%?%p1%{1}%=%th%el%;,
	use=screen-256color,
